{"3682170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wobble Wars", "steam_appid": 3682170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wobble Wars: Physics-Based Chaos. Competitive Mayhem.</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, bounce, dash, and smash your way to victory in <strong>Wobble Wars</strong>, a free-to-play, fast-paced physics-based multiplayer arena game where every hit, bump, and fall is pure mayhem. Play solo, online, or with friends — and prove who’s the ultimate wobble champion!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Combat</strong> — Harness momentum, power-ups, ricochets, and dashes to send opponents flying off the competition or straight into traps. Every hit feels dynamic thanks to fully simulated physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Movement</strong> — Master precision rolling, spin boosts, bounce timing, and wall ricochets to outplay your rivals. Easy to pick up, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Madness</strong> — Jump into matches with up to 8 players online or go local with split-screen multiplayer. Laugh, rage, and roll together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes Galore</strong> — Compete in Capture the Flag, One Flag, Races, Football, King of the Hill, and more. Expect rotating events and seasonal chaos to keep gameplay fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization &amp; Progression</strong> — Unlock hundreds of skins, trails, flags, emotes, and taunts to personalize your wobble and show off your unique style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constantly Evolving</strong> — Enjoy new maps, updates, and limited-time events with every season. The chaos never stops!</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You’ll Love It</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wobble Wars</strong> combines the chaotic fun of party games with the depth of competitive multiplayer, delivering an experience that’s equally fun for casual players and hardcore competitors. Whether you’re rolling with friends or facing global players in ranked arenas — it’s pure, physics-driven fun.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wobble Wars: Physics-Based Chaos. Competitive Mayhem.</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, bounce, dash, and smash your way to victory in <strong>Wobble Wars</strong>, a free-to-play, fast-paced physics-based multiplayer arena game where every hit, bump, and fall is pure mayhem. Play solo, online, or with friends — and prove who’s the ultimate wobble champion!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Combat</strong> — Harness momentum, power-ups, ricochets, and dashes to send opponents flying off the competition or straight into traps. Every hit feels dynamic thanks to fully simulated physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Movement</strong> — Master precision rolling, spin boosts, bounce timing, and wall ricochets to outplay your rivals. Easy to pick up, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Madness</strong> — Jump into matches with up to 8 players online or go local with split-screen multiplayer. Laugh, rage, and roll together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes Galore</strong> — Compete in Capture the Flag, One Flag, Races, Football, King of the Hill, and more. Expect rotating events and seasonal chaos to keep gameplay fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization &amp; Progression</strong> — Unlock hundreds of skins, trails, flags, emotes, and taunts to personalize your wobble and show off your unique style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constantly Evolving</strong> — Enjoy new maps, updates, and limited-time events with every season. The chaos never stops!</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You’ll Love It</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wobble Wars</strong> combines the chaotic fun of party games with the depth of competitive multiplayer, delivering an experience that’s equally fun for casual players and hardcore competitors. Whether you’re rolling with friends or facing global players in ranked arenas — it’s pure, physics-driven fun.</p>", "short_description": "Wobble Wars is a fast-paced, physics-based multiplayer (Non Shooter) Capture the Flag, where rolling, bouncing, and bashing are the keys to victory. Compete in hilarious arenas, master momentum-based movement, and customize your wobble warrior in the ultimate spherical showdown!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682170/ae0ed08a9274c5c6fd39e498b0166b6e432a8f04/header.jpg?t=1776420456", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682170/d71260258ece393afe7e9c428bf4d71c4ae6986e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776420456", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682170/d71260258ece393afe7e9c428bf4d71c4ae6986e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776420456", "website": "https://playwobblewars.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent (DirectX 11 compatible)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3000 MB available 